{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/graveline/items/680528/", "pk": 680528, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/graveline/", "pk": 137420, "shortname": "graveline", "name": "Grave Line Tours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Death Becomes Her Funeral Limo Tour of Los Angeles", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "Death Becomes Her Funeral Limo Tour of Los Angeles", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "Coffin has shut!", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 2.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 2.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 7000, "description": "Los Angeles is the perfect city for tragedy. Seedy lots and haunted hotels of Downtown, scandals winding along Sunset Blvd, and the secretive estates of Beverly Hills serve as the backdrop for dreams gnarled in on themselves. See all the wrong homes at the right time to visit--afterwards!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "6801 Hollywood Blvd, Hollywood, CA 90028", "booking_notes": "It is the sad duty of Grave Line Tours to announce the tragic passing of certain magnificent individuals, precious few of whom died peacefully at their home. A private memorial service will be held inside of a beautifully melancholic restored vintage Cadillac funeral limousine. Tissues will be on hand in case of bouts of severe sadness.  \n\nThe service commences strictly on schedule. \nOnce more, the service starts on time. \nTherefore, please keep in mind that the service starts on schedule, as the dead wait for no one.\n\nLoved ones, acquaintances and mourners shall gather at the Ovation Center, 6801 Hollywood Blvd, Los Angeles 90028 at Hollywood and Highland. If you park in Ovation, take the elevator to level 2. If you’re walking in from Hollywood Blvd, please ascend the unnaturally wide steps opposite the El Capitan Theater. Or, from Highland, up the staircase near the light at Yucca.  Once in the level 2 courtyard, look for your guide on the side of the “Pandora” store, by the entry to the grand courtyard.\n\nFor more information and photos of the meeting point, kindly please visit https://graveline.rip/pages/tour-info. \n\nThere is ample parking in the dark labyrinth known as a “garage” underneath the Ovation Hollywood center. For information on directions and parking rates, please inspect their site directly. Grave Line Tours does not validate as of now, but there are several frighteningly wondrous shops, theaters and eateries you may find yourself looking to donate to before or after your ride, in the name of the departed and cheaper parking. Please do not bring food or drink (apart from bottled water, holy is fine too) into the vehicle. \n\nA mortuary associate will be present at the meeting point to welcome your presence twenty minutes prior to taking your seats in the service.  We strongly advise you to allow PLENTY of time to find parking and make the journey from there up to the meeting point. Los Angeles is big and traffic can be really bad here, and— like all tragic occurences, is almost always worse than you even plan for.  \n\nTherefore we urge you as strongly as mortally possible to arrive at the MEETING POINT (not parking structure) 15-20 MINUTES **before** your service is set to depart. It is unfortunately impossible to disrupt the service with a call once the tour has begun.  (Texting us to let us know you're running late does not change anything.) So please, lovely Grave Line mourner, be forewarned: there is simply no way to join the memorial service other than on time at the initial congregating spot.  \n\nLook for a friendly woman! In the event you do not find your guide to the service, please call Blaze at (310) 621-3023. International mourners can Whatsapp her at +1 310 621-3023.\n\nDid we mention you will need to allow PLENTY of time because of Los Angeles traffic and unforeseen circumstances?  Heed our Warning, and don’t miss your chance to bid farewell to souls departed!\n\nIn lieu of flowers please bring your fondest memories of the decedents to share. Thank you.", "cancellation_notes": "We offer a 100% refund for customers that contact us at least 24 hours in advance of their scheduled departure. Cancellations with fewer than 24 hours notice will not be issued a refund.  No shows including those that arrive late for their departure time will be charged 100% without rescheduling option. (Hey! Allow PLENTY of time to get to your meeting spot!)", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Ages 18+ • True Crime Sightseeing Limo Tour", "short_description": "A two-hour guided limo tour of Los Angeles’ most notorious true crime, scandal and paranormal sites.", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/graveline/items/680528/images/1644933/", "pk": 1644933, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4tVjDoPQt2rowJhpeefs", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4tVjDoPQt2rowJhpeefs", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/graveline/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/graveline/items/680528/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4tVjDoPQt2rowJhpeefs",